    whyNotBuild: "Nothing in the Singapore unit's mandate makes conversational infrastructure a build candidate: it would be a single-market investment competing against a group platform roadmap it does not control. The value on offer is a governed layer that handles Singapore's language mix and channel reality, integrates to local systems, and can be shown to group as a repeatable template rather than a one-off.",
